<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">

        <p>If you placed an order on Lively and need to cancel it, here's what you should know. Order cancellations depend on the seller's processing stage and whether the item has already shipped.</p>

        <p><strong>On this page:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#when-you-can-cancel">When you can cancel an order</a></li>
            <li><a href="#when-cancellation-isnt-possible">When cancellation isn't possible</a></li>
            <li><a href="#how-to-request">How to request a cancellation</a></li>
            <li><a href="#what-happens-after">What happens after you request</a></li>
            <li><a href="#refund-timelines">Refund timelines</a></li>
            <li><a href="#faqs">FAQs</a></li>
        </ul>

        <hr />

        <h2 id="when-you-can-cancel">When You Can Cancel an Order</h2>

        <p>You may be able to cancel your order if:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>The seller <strong>has not shipped</strong> the item yet</li>
            <li>The order is still marked as <strong>Processing</strong> in your Activity tab</li>
            <li>The order was placed very <strong>recently</strong> (usually within minutes to a few hours depending on the seller)</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Some sellers process orders quickly after live shows, so cancellation windows can be short.</p>

        <hr />

        <h2 id="when-cancellation-isnt-possible">When Cancellation Isn't Possible</h2>

        <p>You typically cannot cancel an order if:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>The order status is <strong>Shipped</strong></li>
            <li>A <strong>tracking number</strong> has already been assigned</li>
            <li>The item was marked <strong>Final Sale</strong></li>
            <li>The order was part of a <strong>custom or made-to-order item</strong></li>
        </ul>

        <p>If your order has already shipped, you may still be eligible for a return depending on the seller's return policy.</p>

        <hr />

        <h2 id="how-to-request">How to Request a Cancellation</h2>

        <p>Follow these steps in the Lively app:</p>
        <ol>
            <li>Open the Lively app</li>
            <li>Go to Activity</li>
            <li>Tap Purchases</li>
            <li>Select the order you want to cancel</li>
            <li>Tap Order details</li>
            <li>If eligible, tap Request cancellation</li>
            <li>Choose a reason for cancellation</li>
            <li>Submit your request</li>
        </ol>

        <p>The seller will be notified and can either approve or decline the request.</p>

        <hr />

        <h2 id="what-happens-after">What Happens After You Request</h2>

        <p><strong>If the seller approves:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li>Your order will be canceled</li>
            <li>You'll receive a confirmation notification</li>
            <li>A refund will be processed to your original payment method</li>
        </ul>

        <p><strong>If the seller declines:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li>The order will continue processing</li>
            <li>You may still contact the seller through <a href="#">Order Support Chat</a> for further help</li>
        </ul>

        <hr />

        <h2 id="refund-timelines">Refund Timelines</h2>

        <p>Once a cancellation is approved:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Card payments:</strong> 3–10 business days</li>
            <li><strong>Wallet/credits:</strong> Usually within 24 hours</li>
            <li><strong>Buy Now, Pay Later:</strong> Your payment schedule will be adjusted automatically by the provider</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Refund timing can vary depending on your bank or payment provider.</p>

        <h3>Important Things to Know</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Canceling an order <strong>does not guarantee approval</strong> — sellers control whether they can stop shipment</li>
            <li>Shipping fees may not be refundable if the seller has already prepared the package</li>
            <li>Repeated cancellation requests may affect seller response priority</li>
        </ul>

        <hr />

        <h2 id="faqs">FAQs</h2>

        <h3>Why don't I see a cancel button?</h3>
        <p>The order may already be shipped or no longer eligible for cancellation.</p>

        <h3>Can I cancel during a live show purchase?</h3>
        <p>Yes, but only if the seller hasn't processed or shipped the order yet.</p>

        <h3>What if the seller doesn't respond?</h3>
        <p>You can contact Lively Support if there's no response within 48 hours.</p>

        <h3>Will I be charged a cancellation fee?</h3>
        <p>No, Lively does not charge cancellation fees, but sellers may have policies for custom or special items.</p>

        <h3>Can I cancel part of a bundle order?</h3>
        <p>No, bundle orders must be canceled in full unless the seller offers a custom adjustment.</p>

